{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># A Perfect Blend of Nostalgia and Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderKing is a side-scrolling MMORPG that combines classic 2D graphics with a modern combat feel. With simple controls, you can unleash flashy skills that fill the screen and enjoy the thrill of hunting down hordes of monsters in the field. Choose from four distinct starting classes\u2014Swordsman, Mage, Archer, and Thief\u2014and grow your character to unlock eight advanced classes, experiencing even more powerful skills and spectacular effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Strategic Boss Raids with Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful boss monsters like Pruneus are daunting to face alone, but with allies, you have nothing to fear. Form a party of up to 5 players and utilize the unique characteristics of each class to engage in strategic cooperative play against massive threats. Conquer various powerful bosses and succeed in raids to earn legendary items worthy of your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># My Unique Style, Community, and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a fierce battle, relax in town and show off your unique personality. Complete your style from head to toe with hundreds of costume combinations, and set off on adventures with cute pets that boost your stats or mounts that help you travel quickly. Gather in the town square to chat with other users, use various character expressions to show your emotions, and forge new bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># An Endlessly Unfolding World of Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, take a break from fighting monsters. Test your limits by challenging platforming sections that require delicate control, or spend a relaxing time discovering various activities hidden throughout the fields. Additionally, special seasonal events\u2014such as beautiful maps filled with cherry blossoms\u2014will bring unique fun and vitality to your adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825780?t=1774483766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/e0d819aea42cf571d947c49100f128ed637d5375/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774483766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/0e281331db8c1e631d6424d548088ff6a9aa6295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774483766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/0e281331db8c1e631d6424d548088ff6a9aa6295/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774483766","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/c5fabd736d7c2d06dc4cfb21d6b7b25f.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># A Perfect Blend of Nostalgia and Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderKing is a side-scrolling MMORPG that combines classic 2D graphics with a modern combat feel. With simple controls, you can unleash flashy skills that fill the screen and enjoy the thrill of hunting down hordes of monsters in the field. Choose from four distinct starting classes\u2014Swordsman, Mage, Archer, and Thief\u2014and grow your character to unlock eight advanced classes, experiencing even more powerful skills and spectacular effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/3fa06d8e7430dc0b2aaec637de105027.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># Strategic Boss Raids with Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful boss monsters like Pruneus are daunting to face alone, but with allies, you have nothing to fear. Form a party of up to 5 players and utilize the unique characteristics of each class to engage in strategic cooperative play against massive threats. Conquer various powerful bosses and succeed in raids to earn legendary items worthy of your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/587cd9af9cd53d86ba64096fbf7786b5.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># My Unique Style, Community, and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a fierce battle, relax in town and show off your unique personality. Complete your style from head to toe with hundreds of costume combinations, and set off on adventures with cute pets that boost your stats or mounts that help you travel quickly. Gather in the town square to chat with other users, use various character expressions to show your emotions, and forge new bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.poster.avif?t=1774483766\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.webm?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/a22d9f1480c460d90dae6aebdd33d38d.mp4?t=1774483766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong># An Endlessly Unfolding World of Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, take a break from fighting monsters. Test your limits by challenging platforming sections that require delicate control, or spend a relaxing time discovering various activities hidden throughout the fields. Additionally, special seasonal events\u2014such as beautiful maps filled with cherry blossoms\u2014will bring unique fun and vitality to your adventure.</p>","developers":["dreamideasoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/e819ce20d48b4022cebbf7b021b7975f802cf74e/header.jpg?t=1774483766","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825780/369440145/8651aae7247f0a3546223304710effeb76230e10/1769157164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769157605","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825780/369440145/8651aae7247f0a3546223304710effeb76230e10/1769157164/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769157605","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825780/369440145/8651aae7247f0a3546223304710effeb76230e10/1769157164/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769157605","id":257271124,"name":"WonderKing0123-1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257271124/22a59c55d8c30c1d6c26c300ca045746d94b45f6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769157605"}],"name":"WonderKing","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window\u00ae 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Process<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<